  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"2206\">\n<li data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1943\">\n<p data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1762\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1760\">ROS1 Positive:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1943\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1858\">\n<p data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1858\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\">Indicates the presence of <strong data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1813\">ROS1 gene fusion</strong>, which is an actionable mutation in NSCLC.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1943\">\n<p data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1943\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\">Eligible for <strong data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1902\">ROS1 inhibitor therapy</strong> (Crizotinib, Entrectinib, Lorlatinib).</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"2088\">\n<p data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"1967\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"1965\">ROS1 Negative:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1970\" data-end=\"2088\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"1970\" data-end=\"2088\">\n<p data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"2088\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\">No rearrangement detected; standard treatment applies unless other actionable mutations (EGFR, ALK, KRAS) are found.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2206\">\n<p data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2108\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2106\">Equivocal:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2206\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2206\">\n<p data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2206\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\">If near threshold (10&ndash;15%), <strong data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2205\">repeat test or confirm with alternate method (NGS or RT-PCR)</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
